{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore The Universe in a shiny new spaceship. Travel from planet to planet, fight against an evil Dr.Meowcraft and robots, save the kidnapped kittens! CHIP is a 2D Metroidvania platformer in retro-style where you are a space rescuer of kittens. Run, jump, climb, and shoot your way through high-tech cities, mysterious rocks, and majestic forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1746113305\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the galaxy and travel between 5 planets aboard your trusty spaceship. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Secret locations await the most curious players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock new abilities, upgrade your blaster, and battle the evil robot army of Dr. Meowcraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enjoy slick Game Boy-style pixel art in 320x180 resolution \u2014 old school has never looked this cool!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, run, climb, and dodge \u2014 every level is packed with traps, enemies, and unexpected twists!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/extras/landing_rocket_.gif?t=1746113305\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1029830?t=1746113305","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1029830?t=1746113305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746113305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746113305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharin